# Applies env/cortex-a53-errata to every package. arm64 only: copied into
# /etc/portage/package.env/ by gentoo-build/emerge.sh, by the catalyst
# stage3 confdir in gentoo-build/Containerfile-catalyst-stage3, and by
# image-builder for its chroot merge, each keyed on the build arch. env/
# itself is copied unconditionally and is inert without this file
*/* cortex-a53-errata
